            "boundElements": null,
            "updated": 1785136326352,
            "link": null,
            "locked": false,
            "text": "runs synchronously - the session waits, so\nno task can race a half-installed VM",
            "fontSize": 16,
            "fontFamily": 5,
            "textAlign": "left",
            "verticalAlign": "top",
            "containerId": null,
            "originalText": "runs synchronously - the session waits, so\nno task can race a half-installed VM",
            "autoResize": true,
            "lineHeight": 1.25
        },
        {
            "id": "n2",
            "type": "text",
            "x": 60,
            "y": 730,
            "width": 845.125,
            "height": 60,
            "angle": 0,
            "strokeColor": "#495057",
            "backgroundColor": "transparent",
            "fillStyle": "solid",
            "strokeWidth": 2,
            "strokeStyle": "solid",
            "roughness": 1,
            "opacity": 100,
            "groupIds": [],
            "frameId": null,
            "index": "aK",
            "roundness": null,
            "seed": 1400606658,
            "version": 2,
            "versionNonce": 514403586,
            "isDeleted": false,
            "boundElements": null,
            "updated": 1785136326352,
            "link": null,
            "locked": false,
            "text": "Cursor's install command takes an arbitrary path, so it runs ai-coding/hooks/cloud-agent-bootstrap.sh straight from the source tree\nand needs no mirror. Claude Code discovers hooks by path inside .claude/, so make mirrors copies the adapter to .claude/hooks/ and\nsettings.json invokes that copy; the adapter then execs the bootstrap sitting beside it.",
            "fontSize": 16,
            "fontFamily": 5,
            "textAlign": "left",
            "verticalAlign": "top",
            "containerId": null,
            "originalText": "Cursor's install command takes an arbitrary path, so it runs ai-coding/hooks/cloud-agent-bootstrap.sh straight from the source tree\nand needs no mirror. Claude Code discovers hooks by path inside .claude/, so make mirrors copies the adapter to .claude/hooks/ and\nsettings.json invokes that copy; the adapter then execs the bootstrap sitting beside it.",
            "autoResize": true,
            "lineHeight": 1.25
        },
        {
            "id": "n3",
            "type": "text",
            "x": 60,
            "y": 850,
            "width": 899.078125,
            "height": 40,
            "angle": 0,
            "strokeColor": "#495057",
            "backgroundColor": "transparent",
            "fillStyle": "solid",
            "strokeWidth": 2,
            "strokeStyle": "solid",
            "roughness": 1,
            "opacity": 100,
            "groupIds": [],
            "frameId": null,
            "index": "aL",
            "roundness": null,
            "seed": 1603781982,
            "version": 2,
            "versionNonce": 1569561630,
            "isDeleted": false,
            "boundElements": null,
            "updated": 1785136326352,
            "link": null,
            "locked": false,
            "text": "Guard: session-start.sh exits 0 unless CLAUDE_CODE_REMOTE=true, so a local Claude Code session on an already-provisioned machine\nnever apt-installs behind the developer's back; ./install.sh stays in charge there.",
            "fontSize": 16,
            "fontFamily": 5,
            "textAlign": "left",
            "verticalAlign": "top",
            "containerId": null,
            "originalText": "Guard: session-start.sh exits 0 unless CLAUDE_CODE_REMOTE=true, so a local Claude Code session on an already-provisioned machine\nnever apt-installs behind the developer's back; ./install.sh stays in charge there.",
            "autoResize": true,
            "lineHeight": 1.25
        },
